msgstr "Écriture d'extourne"

#. module: account_reversal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_reversal/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The move has already been reversed, so you are not allowed to mark it as to "
"be reversed."
msgstr ""
"L'écriture a déjà été extournée, vous ne pouvez donc pas la marquer comme "
"à extourner."

